    sou "你不是在耍我吧？" with d

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:590
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_b982a296:

    # mc "I am not."
    mc "我没有。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:591
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_f006f356:

    # mc "So? What's it going to be? Do you accept it or not?"
    mc "所以呢？怎么样？接不接？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:592
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_3b33519e_2:

    # sou "..." with dd
    sou "……" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:596
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_48f5e9d6:

    # sou "Heh... I'll admit I wasn't expecting that."
    sou "呵……我承认，没想到你会说这个。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:597
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_79f7082a:

    # sou "Sure, why not? Let's see if you can pull {i}that{/i} off. Deal."
    sou "行啊，为什么不呢？我倒要看看你能不能搞定{i}那个{/i}。成交。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:602
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_cbbd23d4:

    # mc "Wonderful." with d
    mc "太好了。" with d

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:603
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_a6fc7055:

    # mc "It'll happen."
    mc "会实现的。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:605
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_9c12ebc8:

    # sou "Can't wait..."
    sou "真等不及……"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:609
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_d509a7cb:

    # mc "Hm..." with d
    mc "嗯……" with d

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:611
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_5742874e:

    # mc "How about your 'buddies', [iz] and [ryo]? They're your gang members, right?"
    mc "那你的「哥们儿」[iz] 和 [ryo] 呢？他们是你的人，对吧？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:613
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_8ab2c16e:

    # sou "I don't know what you're talking about. There is no {i}gang.{/i}"
    sou "我不知道你在说什么。哪有什么{i}团伙。{/i}"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:617
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_606e2d02:

    # mc "Sure."
    mc "随你。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:619
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_36e91349:

    # mc "In any case, what if I offered them similar benefits as well? As an extension of the bonus you'll be getting?"
    mc "不管怎样，要是我也给他们类似的好处呢？算是给你加成的一部分延伸。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:620
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_d5c3c23f:

    # mc "If they take orders from you, they can give you a cut of their earnings. Might end up being even more than the original debt."
    mc "既然他们听你的，就可以把收入分你一份。加起来说不定比原来的债务还多。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:626
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_085d41f5:

    # sou "That's a little more interesting..."
    sou "这个倒是有点意思……"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:628
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_6e1ef435:

    # sou "Still not enough."
    sou "还是不够。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:634
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_e02f1176:

    # sou "How about you also remove all of my strikes?"
    sou "要不你也把我的记过全消了？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:637
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_94104943:

    # sou "And the strikes of [iz] and [ryo], as well."
    sou "还有 [iz] 和 [ryo] 的。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:639
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_fc833de8:

    # sou "How about you remove their strikes as well?"
    sou "那他们的记过也一起？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:641
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_6c2abe3f:

    # mc "Deal."
    mc "成交。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:646
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_12a9c0f2:

    # sou "While we're at it, I want future immunity from those strikes bullshit for me and my bros."
    sou "既然都这样了，我和我兄弟以后也别再因为记过这种屁事被追究。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:651
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_0567aa89:

    # mc "No deal."
    mc "不行。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:652
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_53c4f38c:

    # mc "You're lucky I'm not adding a condition to remove the benefits if you exceed 2 strikes."
    mc "你该庆幸我没加一条「记过超过两条就取消好处」的条件。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:654
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_1da7500d:

    # sou "What the fuck?"
    sou "什么鬼？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:656
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_6dc17164:

    # mc "It's a {i}very{/i} solid offer, [sou]. You know that."
    mc "这是份{i}非常{/i}稳妥的条件，[sou]。你知道的。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:662
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_3a07c7ee:

    # sou "Right..." with d
    sou "是啊……" with d

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:663
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_4f691883:

    # sou "And, in exchange for all that, all I'd have to do is {i}let{/i} [nat] be a student here?"
    sou "所以作为交换，我只要{i}让{/i} [nat] 成为这里的学生就行了？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:667
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_e9b2aa2c:

    # mc "That, {i}and,{/i} not have her work for you. As well as stop harassing [ay] about the debt."
    mc "那，{i}还有，{/i}不能让她给你干活。也别再拿债务去纠缠 [ay]。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:668
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_f0e2d5c6:

    # mc "Hers and [nat]'s will be considered quitted."
    mc "她和 [nat] 的债务都视为结清。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:674
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_26b76c5f:

    # sou "... Hm." with dd
    sou "……嗯。" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:675
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_2b58d0a0:

    # mc "This is it, [sou]. It'll probably be the only way you'll be getting this money. If that doesn't work, I'll have to try some other tactic."
    mc "就这些了，[sou]。这大概是你拿到这笔钱的唯一途径。要是不行，我就得换别的招数。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:679
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_a5064aec:

    # sou "Is that a threat?"
    sou "这是威胁吗？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:681
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_31d42afa:

    # mc "I'm just clarifying your position."
    mc "我只是在确认你的立场。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:683
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_cd291b85_1:

    # sou "..."
    sou "……"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:685
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_dcad4ec0:

    # mc "So? What's it going to..." with d
    mc "所以呢？到底怎么……" with d

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:689
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_b33f7125:

    # sou "... Alright, man, I got it! You don't have to keep pushing it!" with vpunch
    sou "……好吧老兄，我知道了！不用再催了！" with vpunch

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:690
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_ea5e6aee:

    # sou "I'll take the damn deal!"
    sou "这笔交易我接了！"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:696
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_3437f7f9:

    # mc "Well, there you go. Wonderful." with d
    mc "很好。太好了。" with d

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:698
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_9dbfa843:

    # sou "{xpr}Tsk...{/xpr} Yeah, wonderful."
    sou "{xpr}啧……{/xpr} 是啊，太好了。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:699
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_b0b3975a:

    # sou "You better keep your fucking word, or else."
    sou "你最好遵守你的他妈承诺，不然有你好看。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:701
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_0f1dd142:

    # mc "Don't worry. As long as you keep yours, you'll have a hefty income each and every week."
    mc "放心。只要你守约，每周都会有一笔可观的收入。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:702
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_410dc558:

    # mc "All of the mentioned benefits will be applied once everything is set and done, and [nat] becomes a de-facto student at the Academy."
    mc "上述所有好处，会在一切敲定、[nat] 事实上成为学院学生之后生效。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:706
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_8ef5a283:

    # mc "And, of course, they can be revoked if you step out of line without my permission, got it?"
    mc "当然，如果你未经我允许就敢越线，这些好处随时可以取消，明白吗？"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:710
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_6e62db97:

    # sou "Chill. Don't get to thinking you're some mob head or anything like that."
    sou "放轻松。别真当自己是什么黑帮老大。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:711
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_e54928ad:

    # sou "But yeah, we have a deal."
    sou "不过嗯，我们成交了。"

# game/new scripts/009/soushi_talk.rpy:714
translate schinese Soushi_Talk_Ayumi_Debt_29da4f49:

    # mc "A pleasure doing business." with dd
    mc "合作愉快。" with dd

